Left click - Attack\
Q - Normal Ability (3 sec cooldown)\
E - Ultimate Ability (90 sec cooldown)
White numbers are for physical damage. \
Blue numbers are for magic damage. \
Red numbers indicate a crit! (magic damage can't crit)
Certain enemies will be resistant to either physical or magic damage, so be aware!
press 1 - switch to projectile (experimental)\
Shift - Dodge (2 sec cooldown)
1. Kill enemies\
2. Once purple bar is full Lclick chest and it will open\
3. choose item and put in inventory. press I to close inventory\
4. Repeat step 1
I - Inventory\
Left click to place an item in inventory. Right click to rotate.\
Items in your inventory will provide stats that make your attacks stronger.
Item stats\: Physical, Magic, Attack Speed, Crit, Move Speed, Max Health, Defense\
Some items will combine with each other to form a stronger item! 
When you die, all the items in your inventory will be tallied to get your score.
Walk on red square to start!
